Arey Geet! Chal, data engineering ko ek solid analogy se samajhte hain pehle — fir diagram bhi dekhenge.

---

**Soch ek factory ki tarah:**

Teri company ke paas **bahut saara raw data** hai — logs, transactions, clicks, sensor readings. Ye data kisi kaam ka tab hi hai jab koi isko clean kare, sahi jagah pe rakhe, aur analysts/ML models ke liye ready kare.

Ye kaam karta hai **Data Engineer**.

---

**Simple breakdown:**

- **Data Scientist** → Model banata hai, insights deta hai (chef jo dish banana jaanta hai)
- **Data Engineer** → Raw ingredients laata hai, clean karta hai, sahi format mein deta hai (jo chef ke liye kitchen setup karta hai)
- **Software Engineer** → Product banata hai (restaurant ka manager)

---

**Data Engineering ke 3 main kaam:**

1. **Ingest** → Data sources se data uthao (APIs, databases, files, streams)
2. **Transform** → Clean karo, shape do (ETL pipeline)
3. **Store & Serve** → Sahi jagah rakho taaki downstream log use kar sakein

