**Tera project connection:**

Tere dono projects basically **Transform stage** ke examples hain:

- **Customer Analysis** → UK retail raw data liya, clean kiya (null CustomerIDs remove kiye, cancellations hataye), RFM features banaye, models chalaaye → ye sab transformation + feature engineering hai
- **Fraud Detection** → Imbalanced raw transaction data liya, SMOTE se balance kiya, features engineer kiye, model ready kiya → same pipeline

Bas difference ye hai ki real Data Engineering mein ye steps **automated pipelines** mein hote hain (Airflow, Spark, dbt se) — tu ne abhi ye manually Python/pandas mein kiya, jo ki internship ke liye bilkul theek hai.

